# ── Role Categories ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Phase 1: Chief of Staff / Founder's Office / Generalist
# Phase 2: Product Manager, Game Developer added on top.
# The classifier checks every category's keywords and tags each post with the
# category whose keyword matched closest to a hiring signal.

